    summary: "Understand why a timed lock is not sufficient protection for a critical external write.",
    what: "A lease grants coordination ownership for a limited time. An ownership token distinguishes the holder from another client. A fencing token is an increasing value that the protected resource checks so an older worker cannot act after a newer owner has taken over.",
